<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-FREE STATE V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-FREE STATE V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final day</p>
<p>of the three-day match between Free State and India at</p>
<p>Springbok Park on Monday:</p>
<p>Free State first innings 330-7 declared (B.Dippenaar 96,</p>
<p>C.Craven 76, K.Venter 54 not out; D.Johnson 5-78)</p>
<p>India first innings 296-6 declared (V.Rathore 115, V.Laxman</p>
<p>56 not out, S.Karim 53 not out)</p>
<p>Free State second innings (overnight 69-0)</p>
<p> D.Jordaan run out				     66</p>
<p> G.Liebenberg not out				 133</p>
<p> B.Dippenaar c Kumble b Ganguly		    21</p>
<p> H.Cronje not out					28</p>
<p> Extras (lb-8 nb-1 w-2)				11</p>
<p> Total (for two wickets declared)		 259</p>
<p>Bowling: Johnson 13-1-56-0, Ganesh 20.3-3-82-0 (w2), Ganguly</p>
<p>10-0-47-1 (nb1), Raju 16-1-62-0, Kumble 1-1-4-0</p>
<p>India second innings:</p>
<p> V.Rathore b Player		     50</p>
<p> W.Raman c Radley b Bakkes	     9</p>
<p> R.Dravid c Jordaan b Boje	    44</p>
<p> S.Ganguly c Jordaan b Boje	    1</p>
<p> P.Dharmani c Radley b Cilliers     11</p>
<p> V.Laxman not out			 46</p>
<p> S.Karim c Cilliers b Boje	     8</p>
<p> A.Kumble not out			 11</p>
<p> Extras (nb-3 w-1 lb-1)		  5</p>
<p> Total (for six wickets)	     185</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-23 2-78 3-83 4-104 5-135 6-159</p>
<p>Bowling: Cilliers 10.5-2-28-1 (nb3), Bakkes 8-2-34-1, Player</p>
<p>7.1-0-24-1, Cronje 4-0-20-0, Boje 21-4-60-3, Venter 12-5-17-0,</p>
<p>Jordaan 1-0-1-0 (w1)</p>
<p>Result: Match drawn</p>
